Revision history for Perl extension IO-Factotum

0.03 2026-11-16T09:10:05Z

    - Add IO::Factotum::sourcehighlight, which colors source files by
      the source-highlight command of GNU Source-highlight

0.02 2026-11-16T07:46:23Z

    - skylighting: a file whose name does not tell the language, as a
      script without an extension, is colored by the interpreter on
      its first line (#!/usr/bin/env perl, #!/bin/bash)

